# HiVi backend

Read `docs/Backend_Flow.md` before editing.

- Package layout: `controller` → `service` → `repository` → `entity`
- New features: prefer dedicated package (e.g. `reddit/`, `community/`) over dumping into root
- Security: update `SecurityConfig.java` and `AuthTokenFilter` skip paths together
- Secrets: env vars only, never commit credentials
- Prod profile: `application-prod.properties` — no Redis unless explicitly enabling

After controller/security/schema changes, update `docs/Backend_Flow.md`.
